--- design ---
   305	- Agent components (kanban/table/chart/…): data-forward, tight 12/13px type,
   306	  mono numerals, consistent headers (11px uppercase label style), hairline
   307	  `--border-subtle` separators; interactive rows hover `--bg-hover`.
   308	- Diff/code: `--bg-well` body, mono 12px, add/del tints via `*-soft` + solid
   309	  gutter text; filename heads 11px uppercase labels.
   310	- Voice orb: neutral elevated circle idle; recording = solid accent fill +
   311	  `--glow-brand` + pulse; transcribing = warn tint pulse. Kill pulses under
   312	  reduced-motion.
   313	- Composer: ONE compact dock card; the form is the only frame and owns the
   314	  `:focus-within` ring. The chromeless textarea occupies the full first row.
   315	  The second row is one toolbar: voice orb + its settings trigger at left,
   316	  borderless turn-control minis in the flexible middle, and Send/Stop in one
   317	  fixed action slot at right. Idle desktop geometry is 8px dock padding, a
   318	  32px minimum writing row, 4px row gap, and 34px toolbar controls (86px total
   319	  before external margins). Multiline input grows the first row upward to the
   320	  existing 240px cap. No inset textarea well, nested input card, detached
   321	  action button, permanent caption, or control spanning both rows.
   322	- Slide-overs (sessions/rooms): `--bg-raised` panel, `--shadow-lg`, backdrop
   323	  `rgba(6,6,6,0.72)` + blur(4px); 280ms slide with reduced-motion fallback.
   324	- Sessions/rooms/call rows follow the plain-row register (§3): title left,
   325	  mono metadata right-aligned in `--fg-3`, destructive actions revealed on

